          "passage": "Cambridge classical historian Mary Beard published *SPQR: A History of Ancient Rome* in 2015. By the time the book appeared, Beard ______ for nearly a decade on the surviving speeches, inscriptions, and private letters that document the political collapse of the late Roman Republic, and her synthesis of those sources became one of the book's central narrative threads.",
