              "text": "By accepting the policy goal of expanded adaptation finance for vulnerable countries while contesting a specific empirical claim Huq's loss-and-damage framing depends on — that present-day disaster losses can be confidently attributed to anthropogenic emissions — on the ground that, once damages are normalized to changes in exposure, the climate-attributable residual is small relative to the exposure-driven trend."
